		<div class="tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-description tribe-common-b3">
	<p>Are you passionate about wildlife? Do you want to make a difference for natural resource management, protection, and enjoyment? Smoky Mountains Wilderness Watch is a new chapter of the North Carolina Wildlife Federation. The chapter's mission is to rewild, protect, and conserve habitat creating a more livable landscape for humans and wildlife. Join chapter leaders&hellip;</p>
